1
00:00:00,877 --> 00:00:04,277
Okay, I gotta get back to work.
Thanks for listening.

2
00:00:04,447 --> 00:00:09,217
- No problem.
- Hope no girls rip my clothes off on the way.

3
00:00:11,988 --> 00:00:15,048
(Raj:)Come on, we're smart guys.

4
00:00:15,225 --> 00:00:17,425
(Raj:)- We can figure this out.
- Forty-three.

5
00:00:17,594 --> 00:00:19,724
What is 43?

6
00:00:19,896 --> 00:00:23,336
(Howard:)Besides my mom's neck size.

7
00:00:25,735 --> 00:00:27,895
(Raj:)It's the atomic number for technetium.

8
00:00:28,771 --> 00:00:30,201
(Howard:)That stuff's radioactive.

9
00:00:30,773 --> 00:00:32,573
(Raj:)Do you think he's building a bomb?

10
00:00:32,742 --> 00:00:37,012
(Howard:)It took him two years to put together
that Lego Death Star. I'm not worried.

11
00:00:39,182 --> 00:00:40,582
(Raj:)Ooh, this could be something.

12
00:00:40,750 --> 00:00:46,590
(Raj:)Forty-three is the number of calories
in half a cup of fat-free yogurt.

13
00:00:47,924 --> 00:00:49,084
(Howard:)Why would you know that?

14
00:00:49,259 --> 00:00:57,019
(Raj:)I'm sorry, we can't all eat whatever we want
and still stay thin.

